`==<X>` restarts the running Pomodoro [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]with fresh `se<X>` timing, and `==[<X>]#name` swaps a different [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Pomodoro in as the running one (taking over the running session [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]ledger unless a timing is given) while the old one returns, intact,[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]to first future. Every path is atomic, dry-run exact, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]byte-preserving, and explained in both the CLI and the Mac preview.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]pomodoro_override.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/pomodoro_override.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-5z[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-5z/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Lex, parse, and describe the `==` token family[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]override-grammar[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]override-grammar: teach the capture language the `==` family (`==`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`==<X>`, `==[<X>]#name`, `…~<K>`) with `=`-identical claim rules, prose [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]protection for Obsidian highlights, teaching near-miss errors, chain [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]support, the additive capture-parse `override: true` spec flag, editor [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]needs, and `==#` name-completion offsets.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Execute restarts and the idle fallback, with the override JSON[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]contract[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]override-restart[dim] · [dim][/dim]after override-grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]override-restart: route override starts in the executor, run the idle [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fallback, restart the running session in place with fresh `se<X>` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]timing, introduce the full `pomodoro_start.override` JSON object and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`restarted` human output, and start the new docs section.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Execute swaps with ledger takeover and first-future demotion[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]override-swap[dim] · [dim][/dim]after override-restart[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]override-swap: implement `==[<X>]#name` (resolve exactly like `=#name`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]transfer or re-time the session ledger, demote the old running block to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]first future with contents intact), fill the `demoted` JSON, `swapped` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]human output, `=x0` equivalence tests, updated teaching errors, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]finish every bob-cli doc surface.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Give the `==#` name picker its override context[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]override-complete[dim] · [dim][/dim]after override-grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]override-complete: add the additive top-level `override` object [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](keeps_ledger plus the running session) to `bob capture-complete` for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`==` name fields, with tests and the capture-complete docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob Mac Capture restart and swap preview, footer, and [/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]notifications[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-override-card[dim] · [dim][/dim]after override-swap[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-override-card: decode the parse flag and `pomodoro_start.override`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]extend the start presentation with restart/swap/idle variants, render [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the before→after and demoted rows on the start card, retitle the footer [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and notifications, and add real-bob fixtures, tests, and README rows.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob Mac Capture `==#` picker status and row hints[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-override-picker[dim] · [dim][/dim]after override-complete, mac-override-card[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-override-picker: decode the capture-complete `override` object and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]use it for the `==#` picker status line and the running/open row hints, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fix the `=#` running-row hint to teach `==`, with fixtures and tests.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-5z","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-5z.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-b895bfd8f51e307e78f8afc07ab6cc1d","started_at":"2026-10-09T17:26:08.173302+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"e13c64ab7e440fc033607192d089bb20536ce69e7a8c7e46c0554e1cc6fe967e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-5z.6/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"c6008ebc1312a374363779b2efc5db02638833548a782ab490162ce457425452","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-5z.6/meta.json","size_bytes":717},"prompt":{"digest":"d04d1d4cc92aaff43b1bacedd6ba2f8752fe06f0990c3c8f3838e7a0a4897f7d","path":"agents/bbu